    "text": "#include \u003CDHT.h\u003E\nDHT sensor(4, DHT22);\nvoid setup() { Serial.begin(115200); sensor.begin(); }\nvoid loop() { Serial.println(sensor.readTemperature()); Serial.println(sensor.readHumidity()); delay(2000); }",
